# Note: bin/ and obj/ are intentionally not ignored here so they are tracked.
# Explanation: In some projects you may want to track compiled outputs (bin/ and obj/)
# to ensure build artifacts are available for CI, legacy workflows, or when
# consumers expect prebuilt assemblies. Normally these directories are ignored
# to avoid committing binaries, but this repository intentionally keeps them
# under source control. If you decide to stop tracking them, add the following
# lines instead:
#
bin/
obj/
